    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/stock-photos/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Stock Photos is a sleek and versatile theme designed for photographers, photo galleries, image studios, laminating studios, photography exhibitions, stock image websites, online marketplaces, video marketplaces, and creative agencies, making it perfect for Photography Portfolios, Media Services, Stock Image Websites, Photo Licensing, Visual Content, Design Studios, Digital Art, Photo Sharing, Commercial Photography, Image Repositories, Freelance Photography, Content Creation, Photo Editing, Creative Portfolios, Online Photo Stores, High-Resolution Images, Royalty-Free Photos, Editorial Images, Vector Graphics, Media Libraries, and Digital Downloads. It features a clean, retina-ready, and responsive layout that works flawlessly across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, built with a robust Bootstrap framework and SEO-friendly code for fast performance and strong search visibility. User-friendly customization options allow adjustments to colors, fonts, and layouts, while interactive Call to Action (CTA) buttons, CSS animations, and social media integration boost engagement and conversions. With WooCommerce compatibility for selling images and digital content, it becomes a complete solution for photographers and creative professionals seeking a professional, mobile-friendly, and visually compelling online presence. Demo: https://preview.themescaliber.com/stock-photography-pro/"
    },
